// Typechecks test/. The main config already sets noEmit (this package builds with tsup, not tsc),
// but its rootDir is ./src, so test/ cannot simply be added to its `include` — tsc rejects it with
// TS6059. rootDir "." makes test/ legal input. Kept as a separate project for the same reason the
// other packages need one, so every package's `typecheck` script reads the same.
{
  "extends": "./tsconfig.json",
  "compilerOptions": {
    "noEmit": true,
    "rootDir": "."
  },
  "include": ["test/**/*"]
}
